==Battleground==
*8 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Moe Uzumasa & Doge]] spawns as the boss after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

